1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:12,500
Sourcer: the weekly reorder for a small restaurant, quoted and ranked before service.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Type the order like a note. OpenAI turns it into line items.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
An ambiguous item gets a question, never a guess.

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:39,000
The quote request is drafted in the owner's voice. Edit it before it goes out.

5
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Every supplier gets their own AgentMail thread.

6
00:00:47,500 --> 00:01:06,000
A real reply from the supplier's inbox travels through AgentMail, hits the signed webhook, and OpenAI reads it live.

7
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:16,000
Messy prose parses too. Convex re-ranks every quote with a written reason.

8
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:23,000
Approve the recommendation, override any line, and the purchase order goes back in the same thread.

9
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:32,000
Orders and the price watch. Built on Convex with Firecrawl, AgentMail, and OpenAI.
